The Time Tracking module is built in phases from ONE file: `docs/TIME-TRACKING.md`.

When asked to "make phase N" (or the next phase), open it and follow Part A: check the status
table, build only that phase's checklist, run the tests, tick the boxes and fill the status row in
the same commit as the build, report, then stop.
